OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry  
OL,6,Fwith clear spells developing           
OL,7,Fovernight. Turning chilly with some    
OL,8,Fmist or fog patches possible and a     
OL,9,Ftouch of frost in prone rural spots.   
OL,11,CMonday:FAny early mist or fog          
OL,12,Fclearing, then a mostly dry and bright 
OL,13,Fday with sunny spells.                 
OL,15,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:       
OL,16,FCloudier Tuesday with some rain and    
OL,17,Fstrengthening winds. Rather cloudy and 
OL,18,Fchilly Wednesday with further rain     
OL,19,Fpossible, before becoming generally    
OL,20,Fdrier with lighter winds by Thursday.  
OL,21,FTemperatures slightly below average.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
